            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "cristinacristina"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Was liked by the family, but had to increase the heat and longer time for th be Brie to become softer/melted. Found that two cups of maple syrup would be too sweet, but overall good. Was inspired when my husband and I had it as an entree at the restaurant. Some things are better homemade.",
            "datePublished": "2010-04-23T17:34:01.340Z"
          },
          {
