              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Kellu"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Delicious and easy!! A big hit at our party - everyone loved it. The key is real Canadian maple syrup - You can't go wrong. Will make again for sure",
            "datePublished": "2016-01-10T06:51:30.187Z"
